<title>UK: On Demand to announce new product on Oct 8.</title>
<headline>On Demand to announce new product on Oct 8.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>On Demand Information Plc said on Wednesday it would make an announcement on October 8 concerning a &quot;significant product development&quot;.</p>
<p>The product relates to high quality multimedia with full delivery over the Internet and will be demonstrated in about two weeks time.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
